  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  Measurement of the total fiducial cross section for light-by-light scattering in lead-lead collisions at a centre-of-mass energy of 5.02 TeV with 0.48 nb^-1 of data collected in 2015.  The final states used are 2 photons and no further activity in the detector.\n\nThe fiducial region is defined as:\n- 2Gamma\n- pt_Gamma > 3 GeV\n- |eta_Gamma| < 2.4\n- m_GammaGamma must be above 6 GeV\n- pt_GammaGamma must be below 2 GeV\n- aco_GammaGamma must be below 0.01\n",
